  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Among several reasons",
     "texto": [
      "**-고 해서** introduces a reason or circumstance among other possible ones: 좋다 → **좋고 해서** (since the weather was also good), 피곤하다 → **피곤하고 해서** (since I was also tired). It is common in conversation, but it is not simply an informal version of «because».",
      "날씨도 **좋고 해서** 공원에 갔어요 = since the weather was also good, we went to the park."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Compared with -아/어서",
     "texto": [
      "**-아/어서** usually links a cause directly with its consequence. **-고 해서** presents a reason more openly, often with other circumstances implied.",
      "약속도 있고 해서 먼저 갈게요 = since I also have another appointment, I'll go first."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
